{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124283","id":4786487180,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHUv_jA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124283","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124283.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124283.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124283","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124283/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124283/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124283/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cf7b583d5cd68d171c768df896cd855666b0810d","number":124283,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Detach MeshInstance3D from its mesh on destruction to prevent destruction-order bug","user":{"login":"ALiwoto","id":70187458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTg3NDU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70187458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto","html_url":"https://github.com/ALiwoto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALiwoto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nBasically without this fix, destruction happens in this order:\r\n1. MeshInstance3D releases its surface materials. If nothing else is owning them, they are destroyed.\r\n2. Its parent class, VisualInstance3D, [asks the renderer](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7b12e749220a75ef87e800e080bd2732ad46854/scene/3d/visual_instance_3d.cpp#L218) to destroy the rendering instance.\r\n3. but before destroying that instance, the renderer processes pending updates (which can then [try to access](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp#L4431) the already-destroyed materials)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis is the exact path (though there are probably other code paths that can encounter this bug):\r\n\r\n1. `update_dirty_instances` is [called here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7b12e749220a75ef87e800e080bd2732ad46854/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp#L4434).\r\n2. which [processes each dirty instances](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7b12e749220a75ef87e800e080bd2732ad46854/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp#L4379).\r\n3. then the material is [read here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7b12e749220a75ef87e800e080bd2732ad46854/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp#L4237).\r\n4. [Asks](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7b12e749220a75ef87e800e080bd2732ad46854/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp#L4242) whether it casts shadows.\r\n5. and [material_casts_shadows](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7b12e749220a75ef87e800e080bd2732ad46854/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp#L2641) asks for the actual material which will then fail:\r\n```cpp\r\nbool MaterialStorage::material_casts_shadows(RID p_material) {\r\n\tMaterial *material = material_owner.get_or_null(p_material);\r\n\tERR_FAIL_NULL_V(material, true);\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Reproduction\r\n\r\n[mesh-des.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33202500/mesh-des.zip)\r\n\r\nI encountered this on my own machine/godot fork (win64), but I tested it on github codespaces and got the error as well.\r\n(use `--detach-first` to get the behavior of this fix)\r\notherwise it will result in errors:\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n    <summary>stacktrace for stable (4.7.2)</summary>\r\n\r\n\r\n```console\r\nGodot Engine v4.7.2.stable.official.ed1daf0bf - https://godotengine.org\r\nVulkan 1.4.318 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Unknown - llvmpipe (LLVM 20.1.2, 256 bits)\r\n\r\nGodot: 4.7.2-stable (official)\r\nRenderer: forward_plus\r\nDetach geometry before freeing: false\r\nFreeing MeshInstance3D with a pending surface material update...\r\nERROR: Parameter \"material\" is null.\r\n   at: material_casts_shadows (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp:2610)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://main.gd:32)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"material\" is null.\r\n   at: material_is_animated (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp:2597)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://main.gd:32)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"material\" is null.\r\n   at: material_get_instance_shader_parameters (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp:2641)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://main.gd:32)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"material\" is null.\r\n   at: material_update_dependency (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp:2653)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://main.gd:32)\r\nFinished. Check engine errors above; completion alone does not mean success.\r\nGodot Engine v4.7.2.stable.official.ed1daf0bf - https://godotengine.org\r\nVulkan 1.4.318 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Unknown - llvmpipe (LLVM 20.1.2, 256 bits)\r\n\r\nGodot: 4.7.2-stable (official)\r\nRenderer: forward_plus\r\nDetach geometry before freeing: true\r\nFreeing MeshInstance3D with a pending surface material update...\r\nFinished. Check engine errors above; completion alone does not mean success.\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n    <summary>stacktrace for 4.8-dev(e7b12e7)</summary>\r\n\r\n\r\n```console\r\nGodot Engine v4.8.dev.mono.gh.e7b12e749 (2026-10-07 18:33:39 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nVulkan 1.4.318 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Unknown - llvmpipe (LLVM 20.1.2, 256 bits)\r\n\r\nGodot: 4.8-dev (gh)\r\nRenderer: forward_plus\r\nDetach geometry before freeing: false\r\nFreeing MeshInstance3D with a pending surface material update...\r\nERROR: Parameter \"material\" is null.\r\n   at: material_casts_shadows (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp:2643)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://main.gd:32)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"material\" is null.\r\n   at: material_is_animated (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp:2630)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://main.gd:32)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"material\" is null.\r\n   at: material_get_instance_shader_parameters (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp:2680)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://main.gd:32)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"material\" is null.\r\n   at: material_update_dependency (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp:2692)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] _ready (res://main.gd:32)\r\nFinished. Check engine errors above; completion alone does not mean success.\r\nGodot Engine v4.8.dev.mono.gh.e7b12e749 (2026-10-07 18:33:39 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nVulkan 1.4.318 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Unknown - llvmpipe (LLVM 20.1.2, 256 bits)\r\n\r\nGodot: 4.8-dev (gh)\r\nRenderer: forward_plus\r\nDetach geometry before freeing: true\r\nFreeing MeshInstance3D with a pending surface material update...\r\nFinished. Check engine errors above; completion alone does not mean success.\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n## AI disclosure\r\nAI was used in several places to trace the error, explain the reasons and generate the working repro.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type"